The following files in apps/web/public/ are modified forms of the glyph.
The path was not redrawn. It is filled white, scaled, and placed on a
rounded #386a20 tile. The raster files are exports of that mark:

- favicon.svg
- favicon.ico
- apple-touch-icon.png
- icon-192.png
- icon-512.png

The in-app mark uses the same glyph through the @mui/icons-material
ReceiptLong component, which is a separate dependency.
